  "description": "Adds a motion template written as a TypeScript module (meta, params, render) to the project. The editor compiles it, runs it in a sandbox, checks its time budget and determinism, and answers the template_id with pictures of the entrance, middle and exit — or TEMPLATE_INVALID listing every problem with its line, to fix and send again. A template is not on the timeline yet: then call instantiate_template.",
